### note: this is a test file for api calls with the VScode RestClient extension

@baseUrl = https://localhost:8443

### Check backend health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Get all test entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test-entries

### Create a test entry
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Hello from REST Client"
}

### Create a user entry
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Max"
}
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user

### Better Auth health
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/ok


### Register a user using betterauth
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/sign-up/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "name": "TestUser3",
  "email": "testuser2@example.com",
  "password": "MySecurePassword123!"
}

###
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/list-accounts

### delete user
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/delete-user
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "password": "MySecurePassword123!"
}

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### Post slot
POST http://localhost:4000/api/slots
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "description": "Coding mastery",
  "difficulty": "EASY",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-11-05T16:22:30.153Z",
  "durationMinutes": 120,
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### Provide feedback (look for the id)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/interview/8/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Cookie: {{authSession.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{
  "outcome": "optimal-with-hints",
  "signals": [
    "clarified-constraints"
  ],
  "codeQuality": "5",
  "communication": "5",
  "problemSolving": "5",
  "complexityAnalysis": "5"
}

### Get all AvailableCards
GET http://localhost:4000/api/slots/available

### Get all BookedCards
GET http://localhost:4000/api/slots/booked

### Book slot
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/slots/8/book

{
  "description": "Test1",
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### 1. Sign In (Capture response into variable 'authSession')
# @name authSession
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "description": "Test1",
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### get notifs
GET http://localhost:4000/api/notifications/
{
  "email": "testuser2@example.com",
  "password": "MySecurePassword123!"
}

### 2. Verify Session
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/get-session
Cookie: {{authSession.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### 3. Post Notification (Authenticated)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Cookie: {{authSession.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{
  "description": "New appointment booked",
  "status": "UNREAD"
}

### 4. Get Notifications (Authenticated)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/notifications
Cookie: {{authSession.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}


### 3. Create a Slot (Authenticated)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/slots
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Cookie: {{authSession.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

{
  "description": "Coding mastery",
  "difficulty": "EASY",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-10-05T15:22:30.153Z",
  "durationMinutes": 60,
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### 4. Book Slot (Authenticated)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/slots/2/book
Cookie: {{authSession.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}
